OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum seeks #29k for WW2
OL,4,A'greatest raid' medals
OL,5,
OL,6,FFundraising is under way to bring a
OL,7,Fcollection of medals belonging to the
OL,8,Fman who led World War Two's "Greatest
OL,9,FRaid of All" to be displayed in
OL,10,FCornwall.
OL,12,FLt Cdr Stephen Beattie left Falmouth,
OL,13,FCornwall, with more than 600 men in
OL,14,FMarch 1942 to undertake the St Nazaire
OL,15,FRaid, also known as Operation Chariot.
OL,17,FThe "incredibly dangerous" operation
OL,18,Faimed to destroy the only facility on
OL,19,Fthe Atlantic coast able to maintain
OL,20,FGermany's heaviest capital ships such
OL,21,Fas the Tirpitz to keep them from
OL,22,Fdisrupting the key convoy route.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
